gine's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"b9e7ff01e4b1501e7c2eb7ec1b59e665","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"65dbc858f3fdb4e5124ddb8e0a2adacd","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"46ae4940cb8ca1206a7a6413db249d43","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"c24d185470631482fd94faf0718a769c","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"5443ea2a013c71ab49c2fb022b246fae","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"d09240b06b3727293b47133d3e5fd759","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"id":"1c2dc36eb1cde1e05c7f71da972d1c5c","originalFileName":"56944d8e-35cf-4f63-9650-39409b3cdde3-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"log","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":68},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"4b27b7ab0ef0798e036ed072be194c4